{"id":"nos","lemma":"nos","pos":"pron","rank":53,"glosses":["we (masculine plural)","ourselves"],"ipa":"/nos/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nos.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nos vamos a caminar.","en":"We'll walk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439171"},{"text":"Dejó que nos fuéramos.","en":"He let us go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637181"},{"text":"Nos vamos a mudar.","en":"We're moving.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450846"},{"text":"Ya nos podemos ir.","en":"We can go now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443051"},{"text":"Nos quedamos en silencio.","en":"We kept quiet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442949"}]}